### Reject an empty UTC format body

**Severity:** `medium`

A format such as `UTC:` becomes empty after the prefix is removed, but the empty string is then passed to `DateTime.ToString`, which renders the general date/time value instead of using the documented invalid-format fallback. Reject the stripped value before converting tokens so this input cannot silently display an unintended format.

```suggestion
                syntax = syntax.Substring(4);
                if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(syntax))
                {
                    return false;
                }
```
